1
00:00:06,267 --> 00:00:09,139
[indistinct conversations]

2
00:00:14,884 --> 00:00:16,886
WHERE THE HELL IS HE,
STACE?

3
00:00:16,886 --> 00:00:19,454
DON'T WORRY, MR. LYNCH.
I'M SURE HE'LL BE HERE SOON.

4
00:00:19,454 --> 00:00:21,499
YEAH, WELL,
THIS IS RIDICULOUS.

5
00:00:21,499 --> 00:00:24,459
I MEAN, HE GOES ON
IN LESS THAN FIVE MINUTES.MM.

6
00:00:24,459 --> 00:00:27,853
[indistinct conversations
continue]

7
00:00:27,853 --> 00:00:30,073
IT'S ALL RIGHT, MR. LYNCH.
HE'S HERE.

8
00:00:30,073 --> 00:00:32,075
ALL RIGHT,
GET HIM UP ON STAGE

9
00:00:32,075 --> 00:00:34,686
AND I'LL TELL EVERYBODY
HE'S ON HIS WAY.OKAY.

10
00:00:36,775 --> 00:00:40,910
MR. BRAVA, I'M AFRAID
WE NEED TO HURRY.

11
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:44,131
MR. BRAVA, NO ADVANCE COPY
OF YOUR SPEECH

12
00:00:44,131 --> 00:00:47,134
HAS BEEN RELEASED.
WHY THE SECRECY?WELL, COME HEAR IT,
AND YOU'LL KNOW.

13
00:00:47,134 --> 00:00:50,093
CAN YOU TELL US ANYTHING
ABOUT WHAT YOU'RE GOING TO SAY?

14
00:00:50,093 --> 00:00:52,791
YOU WANT A SOUND BITE?
FINE.

15
00:00:52,791 --> 00:00:54,619
PEOPLE WHO TRAFFIC IN HUMANS
ARE LIKE COCKROACHES

16
00:00:54,619 --> 00:00:57,448
HIDING IN THE DARK.[cell phone rings]

17
00:00:57,448 --> 00:01:01,148
YOU HAVE TO EXPOSE 'EM
TO THE LIGHT.WHAT DO YOU MEAN, "EXPOSE"?
WILL YOU BE NAMING SOMEBODY?

18
00:01:01,148 --> 00:01:03,541
MR. BRAVA.[camera shutters clicking]

19
00:01:03,541 --> 00:01:05,804
WAIT HERE.UH, MR. BRAVA.

20
00:01:05,804 --> 00:01:07,632
I'LL BE RIGHT BACK.[Stacey] MR. BRAVA!

21
00:01:07,632 --> 00:01:10,113
[sighs]THAT WAS HECTOR BRAVA,
THE KEYNOTE SPEAKER

22
00:01:10,113 --> 00:01:12,028
FOR THE HUMAN GLOBAL CONFERENCE.

23
00:01:15,379 --> 00:01:19,079
[indistinct conversations
continue]

24
00:01:36,835 --> 00:01:38,881
MR. BRAVA?

25
00:01:38,881 --> 00:01:41,753
[sighs] WE REALLY HAVE TO...

26
00:01:46,106 --> 00:01:49,283
HELP ME! SOMEBODY, PLEASE!

27
00:01:53,113 --> 00:01:55,115
ANDY BURNSIDE--
KANE COUNTY SHERIFF.

28
00:01:55,115 --> 00:01:57,682
AGENT TERESA LISBON. THIS IS
PATRICK JANE, OUR CONSULTANT.

29
00:01:57,682 --> 00:01:59,684
HI.HI.

30
00:01:59,684 --> 00:02:01,947
SO THE VICTIM'S NAME
WAS HECTOR BRAVA.

31
00:02:01,947 --> 00:02:03,993
HE WAS A DO-GOODER.

32
00:02:03,993 --> 00:02:07,475
RAN AN ORGANIZATION CALLED
THE SHELTERING LIGHT FOUNDATION.

33
00:02:07,475 --> 00:02:09,477
THEY FIGHT HUMAN TRAFFICKING.

34
00:02:09,477 --> 00:02:11,522
THERE'S A CONFERENCE
GOING ON.

35
00:02:11,522 --> 00:02:14,525
HE WAS SUPPOSED TO GIVE
SOME KIND OF A SPEECH.

36
00:02:14,525 --> 00:02:16,527
SO YOU'RE THE PSYCHIC, HUH?

37
00:02:16,527 --> 00:02:19,051
NO.
NO SUCH THING AS PSYCHICS.

38
00:02:21,228 --> 00:02:23,230
[camera shutter clicks]

39
00:02:23,230 --> 00:02:25,275
[Cho] ALL RIGHT. THANKS.

40
00:02:25,275 --> 00:02:27,277
[sighs]
LOOKS LIKE CAUSE OF DEATH

41
00:02:27,277 --> 00:02:30,585
IS BLUNT FORCE TRAUMA
TO THE BACK OF THE HEAD.

42
00:02:30,585 --> 00:02:33,370
YEAH, SOME OF MY MEN
FOUND A FIRE EXTINGUISHER

43
00:02:33,370 --> 00:02:36,243
WITH BLOOD ON IT OVER THERE. NO,
UH, USABLE PRINTS ON IT, THOUGH.

44
00:02:36,243 --> 00:02:39,637
IF HE WAS HERE TO MAKE A SPEECH,
WHAT WAS HE DOING BACK HERE?

45
00:02:39,637 --> 00:02:43,380
THIS.
IT'S A TEXT MESSAGE.

46
00:02:43,380 --> 00:02:46,862
"MEET ME THROUGH
THE STAFF DOOR. CARMEN."

47
00:02:46,862 --> 00:02:49,430
TRACKING THE SENDER NOW.

48
00:02:49,430 --> 00:02:52,868
HOW MANY CARMENS
HAVE YOU I.D.'d AT THE HOTEL?TWO EMPLOYEES AT THE HOTEL,

49
00:02:52,868 --> 00:02:55,044
ANOTHER TWO WERE ATTENDING
THE CONFERENCE.

50
00:02:55,044 --> 00:02:58,569
THEY ALL HAVE ALIBIS, THOUGH.
WE'RE GONNA KEEP LOOKING.

51
00:02:58,569 --> 00:03:01,181
HE HAD HIS WALLET ON HIM,
ALL HIS CREDIT CARDS,

52
00:03:01,181 --> 00:03:04,053
A LOT OF MONEY,
SO YOU CAN RULE ROBBERY OUT.MAYBE. WHERE'S HIS SPEECH?

53
00:03:04,053 --> 00:03:05,881
HMM?

54
00:03:05,881 --> 00:03:09,101
WELL, YOU JUST SAID BRAVA WAS ON
THE WAY TO DELIVER A SPEECH.

55
00:03:09,101 --> 00:03:12,061
WOULDN'T HE HAVE THAT SPEECH ON
HIS PERSON, OR NOTES AT LEAST?

56
00:03:12,061 --> 00:03:13,889
DID YOU FIND ANYTHING?NO.

57
00:03:17,284 --> 00:03:21,636
FIND OUT EVERYTHING YOU CAN
ABOUT THE SPEECH.YOU GOT IT.

58
00:03:21,636 --> 00:03:23,594
[moans]

59
00:03:23,594 --> 00:03:25,553
WHAT?

60
00:03:25,553 --> 00:03:28,556
UH,
THERE'S A CONTRADICTION HERE.

61
00:03:28,556 --> 00:03:32,299
THE MURDER ITSELF
FEELS IMPROVISED--

62
00:03:32,299 --> 00:03:34,214
THE FIRE EXTINGUISHER,
THE SEMIPUBLIC LOCATION.

63
00:03:34,214 --> 00:03:36,216
BUT THE SETUP...

64
00:03:36,216 --> 00:03:38,174
THE TEXT MESSAGE WAS PLANNED.

65
00:03:38,174 --> 00:03:40,959
NO ROBBERY TO SPEAK OF.

66
00:03:40,959 --> 00:03:44,746
NO ASSAULT OTHER THAN
THE BLOW TO THE HEAD.

67
00:03:44,746 --> 00:03:46,878
IT DOESN'T FEEL LIKE
AN ANGER KILLING.

68
00:03:46,878 --> 00:03:49,272
IT FEELS MORE LIKE
AN ACT OF DESPERATION.

69
00:03:49,272 --> 00:03:51,840
THE MURDERER WANTED TO KEEP
BRAVA FROM DOING SOMETHING

70
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:53,842
OR SAYING SOMETHING.

71
00:03:53,842 --> 00:03:56,148
THAT'S JUST
WHAT OUR PSYCHIC SAID.

72
00:03:56,148 --> 00:03:58,890
YOUR PSYCHIC?KRISTINA FRYE.

73
00:03:58,890 --> 00:04:00,152
YOU'RE KIDDING.

74
00:04:00,152 --> 00:04:02,067
WHAT, YOU'VE HEARD OF HER?

75
00:04:02,067 --> 00:04:05,810
[chuckles]

76
00:04:05,810 --> 00:04:07,116
RELAX.

77
00:04:07,116 --> 00:04:09,336
DON'T FORCE THE MEMORY.

78
00:04:09,336 --> 00:04:11,120
IT'LL COME,
AND THE DETAILS WILL EMERGE.

79
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:13,514
HOW MUCH YOU PAYING HER,
SHERIFF?

80
00:04:13,514 --> 00:04:15,255
THAT'S NONE OF YOUR BUSINESS.

81
00:04:15,255 --> 00:04:17,648
OH, THAT MUCH? I'M WORKING
FOR THE WRONG PEOPLE.

82
00:04:17,648 --> 00:04:19,998
MS. FRYE, HI.
IT'S NICE TO SEE YOU AGAIN.

83
00:04:19,998 --> 00:04:23,088
YOU, TOO.
THANK YOU. WE'LL TALK LATER.

84
00:04:23,088 --> 00:04:27,136
SO YOU GOT THE SHERIFF
WRAPPED AROUND YOUR FINGER.SHERIFF BURNSIDE IS A MAN
WITH AN ADMIRABLY OPEN MIND.

85
00:04:27,136 --> 00:04:30,748
MM, YES. HE'S ALSO A MAN
THAT LIKES TO WATCH TELEVISION

86
00:04:30,748 --> 00:04:33,229
WITH A CAT
CURLED UP ASLEEP ON HIS LAP

87
00:04:33,229 --> 00:04:35,710
WHILE HIS MOTHER
SITS NEXT TO HIM AND KNITS.

88
00:04:35,710 --> 00:04:38,060
BUT I'M SURE HE'D PREFER
THAT TO REMAIN A SECRET.

89
00:04:38,060 --> 00:04:42,064
WELL, I THOUGHT YOU SAID
YOU WEREN'T PSYCHIC.[mouths words]

90
00:04:42,064 --> 00:04:44,632
OH, HE IS. HE'S JUST
NOT READY TO ACCEPT IT.

91
00:04:44,632 --> 00:04:46,895
ACTUALLY, IT WAS THE CAT HAIR
ON YOUR PANTS,

92
00:04:46,895 --> 00:04:50,420
LACK OF WEDDING RING AND YOUR
GENERAL LIVE-WITH-MOM VIBE.

93
00:04:50,420 --> 00:04:53,989
BUT IF YOU WANT TO BELIEVE
THAT HIS DEAD UNCLE HARRY

94
00:04:53,989 --> 00:04:57,645
CAME DOWN AND WHISPERED IT
IN MY EAR, THEN BE MY GUEST.DON'T YOU EVER GET TIRED

95
00:04:57,645 --> 00:05:00,169
OF YOUR OWN CYNICISM?OH, WEARY AS HELL.

96
00:05:00,169 --> 00:05:02,127
WHAT'S THE ALTERNATIVE?

97
00:05:02,127 --> 00:05:05,348
WHY DON'T WE GIVE THEM A LITTLE
BIT OF TIME TO CATCH UP?

98
00:05:05,348 --> 00:05:08,612
SORRY ABOUT THE MOM THING.

99
00:05:08,612 --> 00:05:17,839
♪♪

100
00:05:17,839 --> 00:05:19,841
[Patrick] I HAVE A QUESTION.

101
00:05:19,841 --> 00:05:21,930
WHAT ARE YOU DOING
WORKING WITH THE COPS?

102
00:05:21,930 --> 00:05:24,628
I THOUGHT YOU WERE
A SPIRITUAL PSYCHOANALYST.

103
00:05:24,628 --> 00:05:27,414
DID YOUR PATIENTS
CATCH ON TO YOU?[chuckles]
I STILL HAVE MY PRACTICE.

104
00:05:27,414 --> 00:05:31,026
WHY, YOU LOOKING
FOR A THERAPIST?UH,
LET ME THINK ABOUT THAT.

105
00:05:31,026 --> 00:05:33,550
NO. I HEARD THAT
PSYCHOANALYSTS ARE A DISEASE

106
00:05:33,550 --> 00:05:35,552
THAT PRESENT THEMSELVES
AS A CURE.

107
00:05:35,552 --> 00:05:38,120
AND ON TOP OF THAT,
YOU ADD IN GHOSTS.

108
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:41,515
REFLEXIVE MOCKERY--A SIGN
OF A TROUBLED SOUL, PATRICK.

109
00:05:41,515 --> 00:05:43,517
YOU GOT BORED, DIDN'T YOU?

110
00:05:43,517 --> 00:05:45,736
GOT TOO EASY
TAKING THEIR MONEY.

111
00:05:45,736 --> 00:05:48,783
NO. I THINK OUR GIFT
OBLIGES US TO HELP OTHER PEOPLE.

112
00:05:48,783 --> 00:05:50,828
OH, IS THAT WHAT YOU THINK?

113
00:05:50,828 --> 00:05:53,440
MM-HMM.OUR GIFT GIVES US
AN OBLIGATION TO HELP.

114
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:56,443
I LIKE THAT LINE.
I'M GONNA USE IT.VAN PELT SAYS
THERE'S A PROBLEM

115
00:05:56,443 --> 00:05:58,270
TRACING THE TEXT MESSAGE
THAT BRAVA GOT.WHAT?

116
00:05:58,270 --> 00:06:00,490
WELL, THE TRAIL LEADS
TO AN ELECTRONIC DEAD DROP.

117
00:06:00,490 --> 00:06:03,101
NO WAY TO TRACE IT BACK.
BUT SHE'S GONNA LOOK

118
00:06:03,101 --> 00:06:05,887
AT HIS OTHER PHONES,
RUN DOWN THOSE CALLS.AND WHAT ABOUT THE SPEECH?

119
00:06:05,887 --> 00:06:08,672
THERE'S NO WORD YET ON WHETHER
HE HAD IT ON HIM OR NOT.

120
00:06:08,672 --> 00:06:11,414
BUT WE HAVEN'T TALKED
TO THE WIFE YET. SHE'S INSIDE.[British accent]
HECTOR AND I KNEW

121
00:06:11,414 --> 00:06:14,199
SOMETHING LIKE THIS
MIGHT HAPPEN. HE ALWAYS SAID

122
00:06:14,199 --> 00:06:17,377
THERE WAS TOO MUCH AT STAKE
TO WASTE TIME WORRYING.WHAT WERE YOU AND YOUR HUSBAND
WORRIED ABOUT?

123
00:06:17,377 --> 00:06:18,943
THE TRAFFICKERS--

124
00:06:18,943 --> 00:06:21,642
PEOPLE WHO PROFIT
FROM THE ENSLAVEMENT OF OTHERS.

125
00:06:21,642 --> 00:06:23,905
HECTOR WAS TIRELESS
IN HIS PURSUIT OF THEM.

126
00:06:23,905 --> 00:06:26,908
IS THERE ANYONE YOU CAN THINK OF
WHO MAY HAVE WANTED TO KILL HIM?

127
00:06:26,908 --> 00:06:29,867
AGENT, MY HUSBAND'S RECEIVED
HALF A DOZEN DEATH THREATS

128
00:06:29,867 --> 00:06:31,956
SINCE CHRISTMAS.
IF YOU'RE ASKING FOR NAMES,

129
00:06:31,956 --> 00:06:35,220
WELL, WE DIDN'T MAKE A HABIT
OF FILING THE NOTES.

130
00:06:35,220 --> 00:06:38,049
HE WAS GONNA GIVE A SPEECH
TODAY. DID HE HAVE IT ON HIM?

131
00:06:38,049 --> 00:06:39,964
YES. WHY?

132
00:06:39,964 --> 00:06:42,227
[Lisbon] WELL, THERE WAS
SOME SECRECY SURROUNDING IT.

133
00:06:42,227 --> 00:06:44,969
UH, DO--DO YOU KNOW
WHAT HE WAS GONNA TALK ABOUT?

134
00:06:44,969 --> 00:06:46,449
NO, I DIDN'T.

135
00:06:50,061 --> 00:06:51,715
THAT WASN'T UNUSUAL.

136
00:06:51,715 --> 00:06:54,457
HECTOR RARELY SHARED THE DETAILS
OF HIS WORK WITH ME.

137
00:06:54,457 --> 00:06:58,243
IT WAS HIS WAY
OF PROTECTING ME.

138
00:06:58,243 --> 00:07:00,811
THE PERSON YOU NEED
TO TALK TO IS RUSSELL BIGELOW.

139
00:07:00,811 --> 00:07:02,987
HE DID RESEARCH FOR HECTOR.

140
00:07:02,987 --> 00:07:04,641
ILSA, UM...

141
00:07:04,641 --> 00:07:07,035
[teacup clatters on table]

142
00:07:07,035 --> 00:07:09,516
YOU'VE BEEN TOLD WHO I AM
AND WHAT I DO?

143
00:07:09,516 --> 00:07:11,518
UH, YES.

144
00:07:11,518 --> 00:07:13,911
MY COMMUNICATION
WITH THE OTHER SIDE IS LIKE

145
00:07:13,911 --> 00:07:16,958
A LONG-DISTANCE PHONE CALL
WITH A BAD CONNECTION.

146
00:07:16,958 --> 00:07:20,265
SO OFTEN THE MESSAGES I RECEIVE
ARE MEANINGLESS TO ME,

147
00:07:20,265 --> 00:07:24,444
BUT NOT TO THOSE WITH ONES
WHO'VE PASSED OVER, OKAY?

148
00:07:24,444 --> 00:07:27,838
I'M REALLY NOT BIG ON THIS, UM,
SUPERNATURAL STUFF.

149
00:07:27,838 --> 00:07:29,231
YOU'RE NOT ALONE.

150
00:07:34,802 --> 00:07:37,761
YOUR HUSBAND WANTS ME
TO REMIND YOU OF SOMETHING--

151
00:07:37,761 --> 00:07:39,937
SOMETHING THAT WILL
MAKE YOU SMILE. IT'S, UH...

152
00:07:39,937 --> 00:07:43,724
I'M GETTING AN IMAGE
OF, UM... CHERRY BLOSSOMS?

153
00:07:45,421 --> 00:07:46,944
DOES THAT MEAN
ANYTHING TO YOU?

154
00:07:46,944 --> 00:07:49,077
YES. UH...

155
00:07:50,818 --> 00:07:54,386
WE WERE MARRIED
UNDER A CHERRY TREE.

156
00:07:54,386 --> 00:07:56,998
HOW COULD YOU KNOW THAT?

157
00:07:56,998 --> 00:07:59,653
HE CAN RECALL FOLIAGE
FROM HIS WEDDING DAY,

158
00:07:59,653 --> 00:08:01,829
BUT HE CAN'T TELL YOU
WHO KILLED HIM?

159
00:08:01,829 --> 00:08:04,396
CROSSING OVER TO THE OTHER SIDE
CAN BE CONFUSING.

160
00:08:04,396 --> 00:08:07,008
IT'S A BIT LIKE WAKING UP
FROM ANESTHESIA.

161
00:08:07,008 --> 00:08:10,054
SOMETIMES IT CAN TAKE A WHILE
TO GET REAL CLARITY.

162
00:08:10,054 --> 00:08:11,926
HUH. OH, WELL, MAKES SENSE.

163
00:08:13,928 --> 00:08:16,539
DOES THE NAME CARMEN
MEAN ANYTHING TO YOU?

164
00:08:16,539 --> 00:08:18,976
UH, THE OPERA. WHY?

165
00:08:18,976 --> 00:08:20,978
[exhales deeply][wind chimes tinkle]

166
00:08:20,978 --> 00:08:22,589
THAT'S PRETTY.

167
00:08:22,589 --> 00:08:24,591
UH, MY TURN.

168
00:08:24,591 --> 00:08:27,202
ILSA... DID YOUR HUSBAND
EVER CHEAT ON YOU?

169
00:08:27,202 --> 00:08:29,204
DID YOU CHEAT ON HIM?

170
00:08:29,204 --> 00:08:30,988
WHY WOULD YOU ASK THAT?

171
00:08:30,988 --> 00:08:32,990
YOU--YOU'RE VERY NOBLE
AND--AND DIGNIFIED.

172
00:08:32,990 --> 00:08:34,992
VERY STOIC.

173
00:08:34,992 --> 00:08:37,212
A JACKIE O. THING
GOING ON THERE.

174
00:08:37,212 --> 00:08:39,170
UH, MAYBE YOU DON'T
GIVE A CRAP.

175
00:08:39,170 --> 00:08:41,042
MAYBE YOU'RE HAPPY
HE'S DEAD.

176
00:08:44,959 --> 00:08:46,961
[glass shatters]

177
00:08:46,961 --> 00:08:48,528
MAYBE NOT.

178
00:08:48,528 --> 00:08:51,139
I'D LIKE YOU TO LEAVE NOW.

179
00:08:51,139 --> 00:08:54,185
GOOD IDEA.
JANE, ENOUGH FUN. LET'S GO.

180
00:08:54,185 --> 00:08:56,187
YEAH.

181
00:08:56,187 --> 00:08:58,276
[slurps]

182
00:08:58,276 --> 00:09:00,931
THANK YOU FOR THE TEA.
VERY TASTY.[teacup clatters]

183
00:09:00,931 --> 00:09:03,238
[Lisbon] COME ON.

184
00:09:03,238 --> 00:09:05,066
[Teresa] NICE WORK.

185
00:09:05,066 --> 00:09:08,025
SHE WAS HIDING SOMETHING.
I WANTED TO SEE WHAT IT WAS.

186
00:09:08,025 --> 00:09:10,419
AND WHAT'D YOU LEARN?WELL, IT'S EARLY DAYS.

187
00:09:10,419 --> 00:09:13,117
SHE'S GOT A GOOD ARM.DID LEARN THAT.

188
00:09:13,117 --> 00:09:15,293
I'M--I'M NOT SO SURE
THIS IS SUCH A GOOD IDEA

189
00:09:15,293 --> 00:09:17,339
I TALK ABOUT THIS STUFF.

190
00:09:17,339 --> 00:09:20,124
I-I-I'M JUST A RESEARCHER,
YOU KNOW? I...LISTEN, MR. BIGELOW,

191
00:09:20,124 --> 00:09:22,170
WE UNDERSTAND
THAT YOU'RE FRIGHTENED,

192
00:09:22,170 --> 00:09:24,389
BUT WE REALLY NEED TO KNOW
WHAT WAS IN THAT SPEECH.

193
00:09:24,389 --> 00:09:27,654
YOU DON'T UNDERSTAND. LOOK,
TRAFFICKING GENERATES BILLIONS.

194
00:09:27,654 --> 00:09:29,177
I MEAN, THERE ARE GOVERNMENTS
BEHIND THIS STUFF.

195
00:09:29,177 --> 00:09:31,962
IT'S LIKE THESE PEOPLE
CAN GET TO ANYBODY.

196
00:09:31,962 --> 00:09:35,096
I MEAN, HECTOR'S DEATH
ALREADY PROVES THAT.THEN WE CAN OFFER YOU
PROTECTION, RUSSELL.

197
00:09:35,096 --> 00:09:37,968
BUT ONLY IF YOU TELL US
WHAT YOU KNOW.

198
00:09:37,968 --> 00:09:40,667
IF YOU DON'T HELP US,
THEN ALL THE WORK

199
00:09:40,667 --> 00:09:43,844
THAT YOU'VE DONE TO STOP
THESE GUYS WILL BE FOR NOTHING.

200
00:09:45,672 --> 00:09:48,631
TRAFFICKERS USE
QUASI-LEGIT BUSINESSES

201
00:09:48,631 --> 00:09:50,807
TO LAUNDER THEIR MONEY
AROUND THE WORLD.

202
00:09:50,807 --> 00:09:52,809
I WATCH AUDIT TRAILS.

203
00:09:52,809 --> 00:09:55,812
WE MADE A CONNECTION.

204
00:09:55,812 --> 00:09:57,814
THAT'S WHAT'S
IN HECTOR'S SPEECH.

205
00:09:57,814 --> 00:09:59,207
WHAT CONNECTION?

206
00:09:59,207 --> 00:10:01,209
HAVE YOU EVER HEARD

207
00:10:01,209 --> 00:10:03,211
OF THE WORLD
ANTI-TRAFFICKING COALITION?

208
00:10:03,211 --> 00:10:05,822
ONE OF THE BACKERS
OF THE CONFERENCE, RIGHT?

209
00:10:05,822 --> 00:10:08,172
YEAH. A MAJORCHARITY.

210
00:10:08,172 --> 00:10:10,479
IT'S RUN BY A GUY NAMED
CHRISTOPHER LYNCH.

211
00:10:10,479 --> 00:10:12,960
THEY ASSISTED US IN SHUTTING
DOWN A BUNCH OF NETWORKS,

212
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:15,615
BUT THE TRAFFICKING CONTINUED.

213
00:10:15,615 --> 00:10:17,529
THE MONEY JUST WENT
SOMEPLACE ELSE.

214
00:10:17,529 --> 00:10:20,707
SO IT TOOK A WHILE TO TRACE IT,
BUT WE FOUND OUT

215
00:10:20,707 --> 00:10:23,535
THE COALITION IS A FRONT
FOR A TRAFFICKING GROUP.

216
00:10:23,535 --> 00:10:26,538
YOU KNOW, THEY USED US TO
SHUT DOWN THEIR OWN COMPETITION,

217
00:10:26,538 --> 00:10:28,802
BUILDING THEMSELVES A MONOPOLY.

218
00:10:28,802 --> 00:10:30,760
HERE.

219
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:33,937
THAT THE SPEECH?MY COPY.

220
00:10:33,937 --> 00:10:36,157
AND WHY DIDN'T YOU
NOTIFY THE AUTHORITIES

221
00:10:36,157 --> 00:10:39,203
ONCE YOU FIGURED OUT
WHAT WAS GOING ON?'CAUSE HECTOR SAID

222
00:10:39,203 --> 00:10:42,076
THAT HE WANTED TO DENOUNCE LYNCH
HIMSELF, IN PUBLIC.

223
00:10:42,076 --> 00:10:45,732
I SAID IT WAS TOO DANGEROUS,
BUT HE JUST WOULDN'T LISTEN.

224
00:10:45,732 --> 00:10:49,474
DID BRAVA EVER MENTION
ANYBODY NAMED CARMEN TO YOU?

225
00:10:49,474 --> 00:10:51,476
NO. NO, NOT TO ME.

226
00:10:51,476 --> 00:10:52,956
WHY?

227
00:10:52,956 --> 00:10:55,219
SO BIGELOW IS SAYING
THAT THE PEOPLE

228
00:10:55,219 --> 00:10:57,874
FIGHTING HUMAN TRAFFICKING
WERE TRAFFICKERS.APPARENTLY.

229
00:10:57,874 --> 00:11:00,485
ALL RIGHT. YOU AND CHO
GO TALK TO THIS LYNCH.

230
00:11:00,485 --> 00:11:03,184
SEE WHAT HE HAS TO SAY
FOR HIMSELF.OKAY, YOU GOT IT.

231
00:11:03,184 --> 00:11:06,578
[indistinct conversations]

232
00:11:06,578 --> 00:11:08,493
[man] ARE YOU GUYS JOKING?

233
00:11:08,493 --> 00:11:11,018
BECAUSE YOUR HUMOR'S
IN BAD TASTE.

234
00:11:11,018 --> 00:11:12,976
HECTOR WAS A CLOSE COLLEAGUE
AND A GOOD FRIEND.

235
00:11:12,976 --> 00:11:15,544
WHO WAS PLANNING TO GIVE
A SPEECH THAT WOULD IDENTIFY

236
00:11:15,544 --> 00:11:18,634
YOUR COALITION AS A FRONT FOR
HUMAN TRAFFICKERS, MR. LYNCH.HE NAMED YOU SPECIFICALLY.

237
00:11:18,634 --> 00:11:20,418
[laughs] LOOK,

238
00:11:20,418 --> 00:11:23,073
SOMEONE IS LEADING YOU DOWN
THE GARDEN PATH, GENTLEMEN.

239
00:11:23,073 --> 00:11:25,075
OKAY, THERE'S NO BASIS
OF TRUTH IN THIS.

240
00:11:25,075 --> 00:11:27,991
SURELY YOU CAN SEE THAT IT'S
IN THE TRAFFICKERS' INTEREST

241
00:11:27,991 --> 00:11:30,733
TO SPLIT US UP,
GET US SUSPECTING EACH OTHER.

242
00:11:30,733 --> 00:11:34,171
LOOKS LIKE BRAVA
WENT PAST SUSPECTING YOU.OH, PLEASE. HECTOR SAW
CONSPIRACIES EVERYWHERE.

243
00:11:34,171 --> 00:11:37,871
YOU KNOW, HE LIKED
BEING IN THE SPOTLIGHT.WE READ THE SPEECH.

244
00:11:37,871 --> 00:11:42,136
IT MAKES
A PRETTY CONVINCING CASE.OKAY, LOOK. WE'RE GONNA
CLEAR THIS UP RIGHT NOW.

245
00:11:42,136 --> 00:11:44,921
I WILL HAVE MY LAWYERS GIVE YOU
ACCESS TO ALL OUR RECORDS,

246
00:11:44,921 --> 00:11:47,358
AND THEN YOU WILL SEE

247
00:11:47,358 --> 00:11:50,100
THAT THE COALITION
HAS NOTHING TO HIDE.DOES THE NAME "CARMEN"
MEAN ANYTHING TO YOU?

248
00:11:50,100 --> 00:11:53,060
NO.CAN YOU THINK OF ANYBODY
WHO'D WANT TO KILL BRAVA?

249
00:11:53,060 --> 00:11:55,497
OH, YEAH, MAYBE
ONLY A FEW HUNDRED PEOPLE.

250
00:11:55,497 --> 00:11:57,499
I JU--UH, WAIT A SECOND.

251
00:11:57,499 --> 00:11:59,414
ONE THING.

252
00:11:59,414 --> 00:12:01,459
SECOND NIGHT
OF THE CONVENTION,

253
00:12:01,459 --> 00:12:05,333
I SAW HECTOR HAVING AN ARGUMENT
WITH A MAN NAMED TARIQ SHARIF

254
00:12:05,333 --> 00:12:07,161
OUTSIDE THE HOTEL BAR,

255
00:12:07,161 --> 00:12:10,642
AND FOR MY MONEY,
THE ARGUMENT WAS ABOUT A WOMAN.

256
00:12:10,642 --> 00:12:13,602
HOW COULD YOU TELL?BECAUSE I KNOW THESE GUYS,
AND THEY DEFINITELY WEREN'T

257
00:12:13,602 --> 00:12:16,910
HAVING A DISCUSSION
ABOUT IMMIGRATION POLICY.

258
00:12:16,910 --> 00:12:21,218
HOW'S IT COMING WITH LYNCH?SAYS A MAN CALLED TARIQ SHARIF
WAS FIGHTING WITH BRAVA.

259
00:12:21,218 --> 00:12:23,699
I'M CHECKING FOR AN I.D.
ON SHARIF RIGHT NOW.I TOOK A LOOK AT THE RECORDS

260
00:12:23,699 --> 00:12:26,702
THAT LYNCH'S LAWYER
E-MAILED OVER. FIRST GLANCE,

261
00:12:26,702 --> 00:12:29,009
COULDN'T FIND ANYTHING THAT
SUPPORTS BRAVA'S ACCUSATIONS.I CHECKED
LYNCH'S PHONE RECORDS.

262
00:12:29,009 --> 00:12:31,402
HE MADE A SINGLE CALL
RIGHT AFTER WE LEFT

263
00:12:31,402 --> 00:12:34,057
THE INTERVIEW TO AN ANONYMOUS
DISPOSABLE CELL.DOES IT SAY
WHERE IT ORIGINATED?

264
00:12:34,057 --> 00:12:38,018
HERE'S THE WEIRD THING...THE CALL ENDS AT A CELL TOWER
OUT IN THE MIDDLE OF NOWHERE.

265
00:12:38,018 --> 00:12:41,064
THAT IS WEIRD.RIGHT? SO WE FIGURED
MAYBE WE'D GO CHECK IT OUT.

266
00:12:41,064 --> 00:12:44,764
ALL RIGHT.HERE WE GO. I GOT HIM.
HERE'S TARIQ SHARIF.

267
00:12:47,984 --> 00:12:49,899
♪♪

268
00:12:49,899 --> 00:12:51,771
I'LL SEE
IF ANYBODY'S SEEN SHARIF.

269
00:12:54,643 --> 00:12:56,036
EXCUSE ME.

270
00:12:56,036 --> 00:12:58,560
[Lisbon]
HAVE YOU SEEN HIM?

271
00:12:58,560 --> 00:13:01,824
HE'S ABOUT 6'2",
GRAY HAIR, MUSTACHE?

272
00:13:01,824 --> 00:13:04,174
HE'S BY THE POOL.OKAY.

273
00:13:04,174 --> 00:13:07,090
♪♪

274
00:13:15,229 --> 00:13:17,666
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?NOTHING.

275
00:13:22,802 --> 00:13:24,194
MR. SHARIF?

276
00:13:24,194 --> 00:13:25,456
YES?

277
00:13:25,456 --> 00:13:27,284
WE'RE WITH THE CBI.

278
00:13:27,284 --> 00:13:29,721
AGENT LISBON. MR. JANE.

279
00:13:31,071 --> 00:13:33,421
WON'T YOU SIT DOWN?

280
00:13:33,421 --> 00:13:35,989
WELL, DON'T MIND IF WE DO.

281
00:13:35,989 --> 00:13:39,993
I WAS JUST TELLING MR. SHARIF
THAT HIS SPIRIT IS TROUBLED.

282
00:13:39,993 --> 00:13:42,212
THERE'S A WRONG
THAT HE BURNS TO RECTIFY.

283
00:13:42,212 --> 00:13:44,127
MM, INTERESTING.

284
00:13:44,127 --> 00:13:47,130
HECTOR WAS AN OLD FRIEND.
I, UH, PUSHED HIM

285
00:13:47,130 --> 00:13:50,481
TO TAKE UP
THE TRAFFICKING PROBLEM.

286
00:13:50,481 --> 00:13:53,745
NATURALLY,
I FEEL RESPONSIBLE.THEY'RE GREAT GLASSES.

287
00:13:53,745 --> 00:13:54,703
YEAH.COULD--COULD I TRY THOSE?

288
00:13:54,703 --> 00:13:57,749
UH, NO.OKAY.

289
00:13:57,749 --> 00:14:01,318
MR. SHARIF, WHY DON'T YOU
TAKE OFF THE SUNGLASSES?

290
00:14:01,318 --> 00:14:02,929
[chuckles]

291
00:14:02,929 --> 00:14:05,148
NOW.

292
00:14:05,148 --> 00:14:08,369
[sighs]

293
00:14:08,369 --> 00:14:10,371
[Patrick] OH![glasses clatter]

294
00:14:10,371 --> 00:14:13,330
YOU GOT A... OWIE.

295
00:14:13,330 --> 00:14:16,246
IT WAS A MISUNDERSTANDING.
HE WAS DRUNK.

296
00:14:16,246 --> 00:14:19,859
IT DIDN'T HAVE ANYTHING TO DO
WITH ILSA, BY ANY CHANCE?

297
00:14:19,859 --> 00:14:23,384
[chuckles]
IT WAS NOTHING LIKE THAT.IT WAS EXACTLY LIKE THAT.

298
00:14:23,384 --> 00:14:26,517
YOU HAVE A STRONG CONNECTION
WITH ILSA--A BOND.

299
00:14:26,517 --> 00:14:28,780
SEE?

300
00:14:28,780 --> 00:14:33,002
[sighs and clears throat]
ILSA AND I WERE VERY CLOSE.

301
00:14:33,002 --> 00:14:35,657
UH... [exhales deeply]

302
00:14:35,657 --> 00:14:39,182
BY CHANCE, WE FOUND OURSELVES
HERE ALONE ON THE FIRST NIGHT.

303
00:14:39,182 --> 00:14:42,055
I EXPRESSED
MY DEEP ADMIRATION FOR HER.

304
00:14:42,055 --> 00:14:45,667
SHE RETURNED MY FEELINGS
BUT WAS AFRAID TO ACT ON IT.

305
00:14:45,667 --> 00:14:47,147
HECTOR FOUND OUT.

306
00:14:47,147 --> 00:14:49,758
HYPOCRITE THAT HE IS,
HE ATTACKED ME.

307
00:14:49,758 --> 00:14:53,066
HOW IS HE A HYPOCRITE?BECAUSE HE WAS UNFAITHFUL
TO HER.

308
00:14:53,066 --> 00:14:56,460
MM. I DID SAY.

309
00:14:56,460 --> 00:15:01,117
MR. SHARIF, YOU WERE SAYING
THAT MR. BRAVA WAS UNFAITHFUL?

310
00:15:01,117 --> 00:15:03,163
I'M A PACIFIST, NOT A COWARD.

311
00:15:03,163 --> 00:15:05,078
YOU DON'T STRIKE ME
WITHOUT REPERCUSSIONS.

312
00:15:05,078 --> 00:15:08,037
I WENT TO HIS SUITE
THE NIGHT BEFORE HE DIED

313
00:15:08,037 --> 00:15:10,126
TO CONFRONT HIM.

314
00:15:10,126 --> 00:15:13,825
A WOMAN WAS LEAVING.

315
00:15:16,132 --> 00:15:18,656
IT WASN'T ILSA.

316
00:15:18,656 --> 00:15:21,094
WAS IT SOMEONE
FROM THE CONFERENCE?

317
00:15:21,094 --> 00:15:23,661
[laughs] IT WASN'T THAT KIND
OF WOMAN.

318
00:15:23,661 --> 00:15:26,708
SHE WAS YOUNG, PRETTY,
UH, CHEAP CLOTHES.

319
00:15:26,708 --> 00:15:29,624
I ASSUME
SHE WAS A PROSTITUTE.CARMEN.

320
00:15:37,458 --> 00:15:39,460
[Cho] FAR AS I CAN TELL,

321
00:15:39,460 --> 00:15:42,115
THIS IS THE ONLY STRUCTURE
WITHIN A HALF MILE

322
00:15:42,115 --> 00:15:44,508
OF THE CELL TOWER
LYNCH'S CALL STOPPED AT.

323
00:15:44,508 --> 00:15:47,468
WELL, I DON'T SEE ANYTHING.NOPE. NOT A THING.

324
00:15:47,468 --> 00:15:49,992
[sighs]

325
00:16:07,053 --> 00:16:08,837
THINK THEY HAVE DOGS?

326
00:16:08,837 --> 00:16:11,144
PROBABLY.

327
00:16:11,144 --> 00:16:13,015
[sighs]

328
00:16:15,496 --> 00:16:17,411
[grunts]

329
00:16:50,574 --> 00:16:51,923
[muffled crying in distance]

330
00:16:51,923 --> 00:16:53,447
HEY, LISTEN.

331
00:16:55,840 --> 00:16:57,407
THERE.

332
00:17:01,324 --> 00:17:04,197
[infant crying]

333
00:17:10,029 --> 00:17:11,639
[grunts]

334
00:17:14,468 --> 00:17:17,340
[thud, chains rattling]

335
00:17:19,995 --> 00:17:22,041
[latch clicks]

336
00:17:24,478 --> 00:17:26,871
[women scream]

337
00:17:26,871 --> 00:17:29,831
[gasping and panting]

338
00:17:29,831 --> 00:17:34,314
[crying]

339
00:17:34,314 --> 00:17:37,317
[speaking indistinctly]

340
00:17:40,885 --> 00:17:43,062
YOU HAVE MISREAD
THE SITUATION, AGENTS.

341
00:17:43,062 --> 00:17:45,455
I AM ENTIRELY IGNORANT
OF WHATEVER IT IS

342
00:17:45,455 --> 00:17:47,414
THAT YOU ARE ACCUSING ME OF. [Rigsby] YOU'RE LYING.

343
00:17:47,414 --> 00:17:49,503
[papers rustle]

344
00:17:49,503 --> 00:17:51,331
WE'VE GOT THE PHONE RECORDS.[file smacks]

345
00:17:51,331 --> 00:17:54,595
YOU CALLED YOUR GOONS
AND TOLD 'EM

346
00:17:54,595 --> 00:17:58,033
TO LOCK THOSE WOMEN UP
SO YOUR GUYS COULD ESCAPE.I'M SORRY. GOONS? WHAT GOONS?
AND RECORDS CAN BE FAKED.

347
00:17:58,033 --> 00:18:01,384
NO, THOSE WOMEN
IN THE TRUCK--THAT WAS YOU.

348
00:18:01,384 --> 00:18:04,300
HECTOR BRAVA--
THAT WAS YOU, TOO.[chuckles] YOU'RE WRONG.

349
00:18:04,300 --> 00:18:06,694
I WEEP FOR
THOSE POOR SOULS YOU FOUND.

350
00:18:06,694 --> 00:18:09,740
AND AS I SAID,
HECTOR WAS A DEAR FRIEND.WHAT ABOUT CARMEN?

351
00:18:09,740 --> 00:18:12,961
WHO'S CARMEN?

352
00:18:12,961 --> 00:18:14,354
AND WHERE'S MY LAWYER?

353
00:18:14,354 --> 00:18:16,530
[clicks tongue] TOUGH.

354
00:18:16,530 --> 00:18:20,055
SOCIOPATH.
WOLF AMONG THE SHEEP.

355
00:18:20,055 --> 00:18:22,057
HE'S A CAUGHT WOLF NOW.

356
00:18:23,537 --> 00:18:25,539
PHONE CALL'S ENOUGH
TO CONNECT HIM

357
00:18:25,539 --> 00:18:27,541
TO ABOUT
20 DIFFERENT FELONY CHARGES,

358
00:18:27,541 --> 00:18:30,544
NOT EVEN COUNTING
THE HOMICIDE.

359
00:18:30,544 --> 00:18:33,329
HE'S GOING AWAY
FOR A LONG TIME.

360
00:18:37,899 --> 00:18:39,944
SHE LIKES YOU, THAT ONE.

361
00:18:39,944 --> 00:18:41,511
WHICH ONE?THE BLONDE ONE.

362
00:18:41,511 --> 00:18:43,948
WHAT?AND YOU LIKE HER.

363
00:18:43,948 --> 00:18:47,430
WHA--I'M NOT SO SURE I KNOW
WHERE THIS IS HEADED.[telephone ringing in distance]

364
00:18:47,430 --> 00:18:49,780
YOU KNOW EXACTLY
WHERE THIS IS HEADED.

365
00:18:49,780 --> 00:18:53,654
DO YOU EVER CONSIDER
DATING AGAIN? DO YOU?

366
00:18:53,654 --> 00:18:56,309
HOW DID WE GET
TO THIS POINT SO QUICKLY?

367
00:18:56,309 --> 00:18:59,399
I'M JUST SAYING, I THINK
IT WOULD BE A GOOD THING.

368
00:18:59,399 --> 00:19:01,227
WHAT WOULD?

369
00:19:01,227 --> 00:19:04,186
UH, CHARGING LYNCH WITH BRAVA'S
MURDER. HOW CLOSE ARE WE?

370
00:19:04,186 --> 00:19:07,320
A CONFESSION WOULD HELP.WELL, WHY DON'T YOU ASK
ONE OF HER SPIRITS?

371
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:09,017
I'M SURE THEY'LL PROVIDE
THE EVIDENCE

372
00:19:09,017 --> 00:19:10,932
THAT'S NEEDED. [chuckles]

373
00:19:10,932 --> 00:19:15,371
WHERE ARE YOU GOING?THIS CASE IS SOLVING ITSELF
WITHOUT ME.

374
00:19:15,371 --> 00:19:17,504
I HAVE ERRANDS TO RUN.

375
00:19:17,504 --> 00:19:18,809
LISBON.

376
00:19:18,809 --> 00:19:20,768
YEAH.

377
00:19:25,773 --> 00:19:28,079
CHRISTOPHER LYNCH
DIDN'T KILL BRAVA.

378
00:19:28,079 --> 00:19:32,432
NO. THE EMOTION HE WAS TRYING
TO CONCEAL WAS CONTEMPT.

379
00:19:32,432 --> 00:19:34,434
LYNCH DIDN'T CONSIDER HIM
WORTH KILLING.

380
00:19:34,434 --> 00:19:37,393
A DEEPLY EVIL MAN, BUT NOT ONE
WHO COMMITTED THIS CRIME.

381
00:19:37,393 --> 00:19:38,960
MM.[elevator bell dings]

382
00:19:47,447 --> 00:19:49,840
[elevator doors close]THANK YOU. [clears throat]

383
00:19:49,840 --> 00:19:52,800
WHAT IF I DIDN'T SAY "SPIRITS"?
WHAT IF I SAID "INSTINCTS"?

384
00:19:52,800 --> 00:19:55,237
WOULD THAT BE SOMETHING
YOU COULD ACCEPT?

385
00:19:55,237 --> 00:19:56,804
OH, WELL, MAYBE.

386
00:19:56,804 --> 00:19:59,894
'CAUSE THEY'RE TELLING ME
TO COME WITH YOU.

387
00:19:59,894 --> 00:20:03,550
ARE THEY? WHY?'CAUSE THE LAST TIME
YOU SPOKE WITH ILSA ENGELS,

388
00:20:03,550 --> 00:20:06,509
SHE THREW A TEACUP
AT YOUR HEAD.IT WAS A SAUCER.
IT WASN'T A TEACUP.

389
00:20:06,509 --> 00:20:09,469
AND WHO SAID I'M GOING
TO SEE ILSA ENGELS?TELL ME THAT YOU'RE NOT.
SHE THINKS WELL OF ME.

390
00:20:09,469 --> 00:20:12,036
I CAN COMMUNICATE
WITH HER HUSBAND.[chuckles]

391
00:20:12,036 --> 00:20:14,517
AND SHE'LL ONLY TALK
TO YOU IF I'M THERE.

392
00:20:14,517 --> 00:20:18,173
WELL, I GUESS I HAVE NO CHOICE
BUT TO BRING YOU ALONG WITH ME.

393
00:20:18,173 --> 00:20:21,872
YOU THINK YOU MANIPULATED ME
INTO COMING WITH YOU, DON'T YOU?

394
00:20:21,872 --> 00:20:24,875
[elevator bell dings]NO, I DON'T. I THINK YOU
MANIPULATED ME INTO THINKING

395
00:20:24,875 --> 00:20:28,401
I MANIPULATED YOU
INTO COMING WITH ME.[elevator doors open]

396
00:20:33,057 --> 00:20:36,931
OKAY, I'M JUST GONNA COME
STRAIGHT OUT, AND I'M GONNA SAY

397
00:20:36,931 --> 00:20:40,326
I'M SORRY FOR THE, UH, OBNOXIOUS
INFIDELITY REMARKS EARLIER,

398
00:20:40,326 --> 00:20:42,806
AND I HUMBLY BEG
YOUR FORGIVENESS.

399
00:20:42,806 --> 00:20:45,026
MM.

400
00:20:45,026 --> 00:20:47,289
SORRY.

401
00:20:47,289 --> 00:20:50,814
WOULD YOU MIND TALKING TO US
A LITTLE BIT ABOUT TARIQ SHARIF?

402
00:20:50,814 --> 00:20:53,861
HE WAS DRUNK. HE SAID THINGS
HE SHOULDN'T HAVE SAID,

403
00:20:53,861 --> 00:20:56,820
AND I EXCUSED MYSELF
FROM HIS COMPANY.

404
00:20:56,820 --> 00:20:59,519
AND THEN YOUR HUSBAND
PUNCHED HIM IN THE FACE.

405
00:20:59,519 --> 00:21:02,522
I DIDN'T TELL HECTOR
TO HIT HIM,

406
00:21:02,522 --> 00:21:04,524
IF THAT'S WHAT YOU'RE ASKING.

407
00:21:04,524 --> 00:21:06,395
I WON'T PRETEND
I'M PARTICULARLY SAD

408
00:21:06,395 --> 00:21:08,484
THAT HECTOR PUNCHED HIM.

409
00:21:08,484 --> 00:21:11,487
HE SAID THINGS THAT HE--

410
00:21:11,487 --> 00:21:13,924
HE ACTED LIKE A PIG
AND AN ASS.

411
00:21:13,924 --> 00:21:16,231
A PIG AND AN ASS?
THAT CAN'T BE GOOD.

412
00:21:18,929 --> 00:21:20,931
WE NEED TO ASK YOU AGAIN

413
00:21:20,931 --> 00:21:24,457
ABOUT THE NIGHT
BEFORE HECTOR DIED.

414
00:21:24,457 --> 00:21:28,156
[exhales deeply] I, UM...

415
00:21:28,156 --> 00:21:30,767
I HAD A DEPARTMENT MEETING.

416
00:21:30,767 --> 00:21:32,769
I STAYED UP IN BERKELEY.

417
00:21:32,769 --> 00:21:35,294
AND, UM,
IS THERE ANY CHANCE

418
00:21:35,294 --> 00:21:39,080
THAT A WOMAN COULD'VE BEEN
VISITING WITH HECTOR THAT NIGHT?

419
00:21:39,080 --> 00:21:41,082
IF TARIQ SAID THAT,
HE'S LYING.

420
00:21:41,082 --> 00:21:44,303
HE WOULDN'T DARE SAY THAT
IF HECTOR WAS STILL ALIVE.

421
00:21:44,303 --> 00:21:45,913
IT'S DISGUSTING.

422
00:21:45,913 --> 00:21:47,871
DISGUSTING.

423
00:21:52,702 --> 00:21:55,792
UM, WELL,
I-I GUESS I SHOULD GO.

424
00:21:55,792 --> 00:21:58,447
OKAY. WELL,
I STILL HAVE SOME BUSINESS

425
00:21:58,447 --> 00:22:00,449
TO ATTEND TO HERE,
SO, UH...

426
00:22:00,449 --> 00:22:02,799
YEAH, I'M GONNA CATCH
A CAB OUT FRONT.

427
00:22:02,799 --> 00:22:04,323
OKAY.

428
00:22:04,323 --> 00:22:05,324
OKAY.

429
00:22:07,804 --> 00:22:10,416
OH, NICE CALL
ON THE CHERRY BLOSSOMS,

430
00:22:10,416 --> 00:22:12,635
BY THE WAY.HOW SO?

431
00:22:12,635 --> 00:22:15,029
THE WEDDING PHOTOGRAPH--
MARCH '97, D.C.

432
00:22:15,029 --> 00:22:17,379
MARCH THROUGH TO APRIL

433
00:22:17,379 --> 00:22:20,556
IS THE ANNUAL
CHERRY BLOSSOM FESTIVAL IN D.C.

434
00:22:20,556 --> 00:22:24,778
PATRICK, YOU CREDIT ME
WITH FAR TOO MUCH CUNNING.

435
00:22:24,778 --> 00:22:27,084
YOU'RE VERY GOOD.
VERY COMPELLING.

436
00:22:27,084 --> 00:22:28,564
THANK YOU.

437
00:22:30,697 --> 00:22:32,481
I'LL SEE YOU LATER.

438
00:22:32,481 --> 00:22:34,004
BYE.

439
00:22:38,095 --> 00:22:40,010
LISBON.

440
00:22:40,010 --> 00:22:42,317
MEET ME AT THE HOTEL BAR.

441
00:22:42,317 --> 00:22:43,971
[snaps phone shut]

442
00:22:43,971 --> 00:22:47,409
CHEERS. OH, SWEETHEART,
THERE YOU ARE. JOIN US.

443
00:22:47,409 --> 00:22:50,499
UH, I'VE GOT US A ROOM,
AND OUR FRIEND HERE...

444
00:22:50,499 --> 00:22:52,240
NOVELLA.

445
00:22:52,240 --> 00:22:56,462
NOVELLA. SHE'S GONNA HELP US
EXPLORE SOME BOUNDARIES.

446
00:22:56,462 --> 00:22:58,333
NO, SHE'S NOT.

447
00:22:59,900 --> 00:23:02,468
WORK WITH ME, TERESA.

448
00:23:07,560 --> 00:23:08,952
MM.

449
00:23:08,952 --> 00:23:10,650
YOU'RE PRETTY, UH,

450
00:23:10,650 --> 00:23:12,391
WELL, YOU'RE
PRETTY ADVENTUROUS, RIGHT?

451
00:23:12,391 --> 00:23:14,567
BECAUSE MY--MY LADY,

452
00:23:14,567 --> 00:23:18,092
SHE--SHE GETS
A LITTLE OUT THERE AT TIMES.GETTIN' THERE NOW.

453
00:23:18,092 --> 00:23:20,094
LET'S GO UPSTAIRS AND SEE.

454
00:23:20,094 --> 00:23:22,444
YOU JUST HAVE TO
WORK THINGS OUT WITH HOWIE.

455
00:23:22,444 --> 00:23:25,316
OKAY. BARKEEP!

456
