HOW CAN I HELP YOU?

457
00:23:27,362 --> 00:23:29,408
ANOTHER BOTTLE
OF THE GOOD STUFF?

458
00:23:29,408 --> 00:23:31,975
UH, NO, THANKS. UH...
[whispers] YOU'RE THE PIMP?

459
00:23:31,975 --> 00:23:34,108
HEY. NOT NICE.

460
00:23:34,108 --> 00:23:36,153
WELL, BUSINESS MANAGER, THEN.

461
00:23:36,153 --> 00:23:38,112
CONCERNED FRIEND.

462
00:23:38,112 --> 00:23:40,984
WHATEVER. WE'D LIKE TO TAKE
OUR LITTLE SOIREE UPSTAIRS

463
00:23:40,984 --> 00:23:43,857
TO A MORE PRIVATE LOCATION.

464
00:23:43,857 --> 00:23:46,686
NOVELLA SAYS THAT
WE HAVE TO TALK TO YOU.

465
00:23:46,686 --> 00:23:49,863
IF IT'S GONNA BE THE TWO OF YOU,
IT'S GONNA BE EXTRA.

466
00:23:52,866 --> 00:23:54,476
[sighs]

467
00:23:54,476 --> 00:23:58,045
SURE. SHE'S PAYING.

468
00:23:58,045 --> 00:24:00,787
I SHOULD PROBABLY TELL YOU
THAT I AM AGENT

469
00:24:00,787 --> 00:24:02,745
FOR THE CALIFORNIA
BUREAU OF INVESTIGATION.

470
00:24:02,745 --> 00:24:05,269
OH, WOW.

471
00:24:05,269 --> 00:24:08,142
SHE HAS A GUN, TOO.
AND HANDCUFFS.WHOA, WHOA, WHOA, WHOA.

472
00:24:08,142 --> 00:24:11,928
THIS IS ENTRAPMENT.
I WANT A LAWYER.WHAT YOU WANT IS TO TAKE
A LOOK AT THIS PICTURE

473
00:24:11,928 --> 00:24:14,322
AND TELL ME
IF YOU RECOGNIZE THIS MAN.

474
00:24:14,322 --> 00:24:17,456
[sighs]
NOPE. NEVER SEEN HIM.

475
00:24:17,456 --> 00:24:20,937
BUT THAT GUY--
HIM I RECOGNIZE.

476
00:24:20,937 --> 00:24:24,637
HE WAS IN HERE GETTING A GIRL
JUST THE OTHER NIGHT.

477
00:24:24,637 --> 00:24:26,856
NO. NO WAY.

478
00:24:26,856 --> 00:24:29,903
LOOK, I MIGHT NOT BE DENZEL,
BUT I DO OKAY.

479
00:24:29,903 --> 00:24:32,340
BESIDES, I COULDN'T AFFORD
A PROSTITUTE ON MY SALARY,

480
00:24:32,340 --> 00:24:35,561
BELIEVE ME.NOT FOR YOU.
FOR YOUR BOSS, BRAVA.

481
00:24:35,561 --> 00:24:38,259
IS THAT SOMETHING
YOU DID A LOT OF--

482
00:24:38,259 --> 00:24:39,869
PROCURING WOMEN FOR HIM?

483
00:24:39,869 --> 00:24:41,741
[scoffs]

484
00:24:41,741 --> 00:24:44,265
WOW. THE MAN'S DEAD.

485
00:24:44,265 --> 00:24:45,919
ARE YOU SERIOUSLY GONNA

486
00:24:45,919 --> 00:24:48,965
DRAG HIS NAME THROUGH THE MUD
LIKE THIS?

487
00:24:48,965 --> 00:24:51,272
I'M NOT LOOKING TO DESTROY
ANYBODY'S REPUTATION, RUSSELL.

488
00:24:51,272 --> 00:24:55,102
I JUST NEED
TO KNOW WHAT HAPPENED.

489
00:24:55,102 --> 00:24:57,060
ILSA WAS BACK IN BERKELEY.

490
00:24:57,060 --> 00:24:59,280
HE CALLED ME

491
00:24:59,280 --> 00:25:02,283
AND SAID HE NEEDED ME
TO DO HIM A FAVOR.

492
00:25:02,283 --> 00:25:05,634
HE COULDN'T GO DOWN
TO THE BAR HIMSELF,

493
00:25:05,634 --> 00:25:07,636
BECAUSE SOMEBODY WOULD
RECOGNIZE HIM.

494
00:25:07,636 --> 00:25:09,595
SOMEBODY COULD'VE
RECOGNIZED YOU.

495
00:25:09,595 --> 00:25:11,248
NOBODY DID.

496
00:25:11,248 --> 00:25:12,902
I WAS LUCKY.

497
00:25:12,902 --> 00:25:14,948
IT WAS HARD FOR YOU.

498
00:25:14,948 --> 00:25:16,950
SURE.

499
00:25:16,950 --> 00:25:20,606
SURE, IT WOULD'VE BEEN EASIER
IF HE DIDN'T DO IT AT ALL,

500
00:25:20,606 --> 00:25:22,564
BUT... [chuckles]

501
00:25:22,564 --> 00:25:26,612
LOOK, A-ALL I COULD DO WAS JUST
KEEP HIM FROM GETTING CAUGHT.

502
00:25:26,612 --> 00:25:30,006
IS THERE ANYTHING
YOU CAN TELL US ABOUT THE GIRL?

503
00:25:30,006 --> 00:25:31,399
UH...

504
00:25:31,399 --> 00:25:34,750
I THINK
HER NAME WAS... CLARET.

505
00:25:34,750 --> 00:25:37,927
CLARET.IT'S FRENCH.

506
00:25:37,927 --> 00:25:40,843
WHAT DID BRAVA MEAN
WHEN HE SAID

507
00:25:40,843 --> 00:25:42,932
HE WANTED
TO MAKE IT REGULAR?

508
00:25:42,932 --> 00:25:45,544
WELL, I MEAN, NOT,
LIKE, ACTUALLY REGULAR,

509
00:25:45,544 --> 00:25:47,589
BECAUSE HE DIED AND ALL,

510
00:25:47,589 --> 00:25:50,461
BUT EVERY THURSDAY AFTERNOON,
IT WAS GONNA BE.

511
00:25:50,461 --> 00:25:54,204
HE HAD A PLACE UP
IN OAKLAND, HE TOLD ME.

512
00:25:54,204 --> 00:25:56,206
DO YOU HAVE AN ADDRESS?

513
00:25:56,206 --> 00:25:58,644
SURE. AND A KEY, TOO.

514
00:25:58,644 --> 00:26:00,994
I THINK IT'S THIS ONE
ON THE LEFT.

515
00:26:00,994 --> 00:26:02,517
YEAH.

516
00:26:06,695 --> 00:26:08,523
[keys jangle]

517
00:26:08,523 --> 00:26:10,786
[lock clicks]

518
00:26:15,269 --> 00:26:17,880
SO WOULD YOU EVER,
UH... [sighs]

519
00:26:17,880 --> 00:26:19,273
YOU KNOW...

520
00:26:19,273 --> 00:26:21,057
PAY FOR SEX? NO.

521
00:26:21,057 --> 00:26:22,798
YEAH. IT'S WEIRD, RIGHT?

522
00:26:22,798 --> 00:26:25,584
WEIRD? NO. EXPENSIVE.

523
00:26:27,629 --> 00:26:30,066
HEY.

524
00:26:30,066 --> 00:26:32,721
CHECK THIS OUT.

525
00:26:32,721 --> 00:26:35,419
"CARMEN."

526
00:26:35,419 --> 00:26:37,030
BINGO.

527
00:26:37,030 --> 00:26:38,509
[Lisbon] WHAT DO YOU GOT?

528
00:26:38,509 --> 00:26:41,382
[Cho] WELL, WE TRACKED
CARMEN'S PHONE NUMBER.

529
00:26:41,382 --> 00:26:44,994
IT'S AN APARTMENT RENTED
TO A SALLY ALVAREZ.SO "CARMEN" WAS JUST A NAME
SHE USED FOR WORK?

530
00:26:44,994 --> 00:26:47,910
MM. ALVAREZ HAS BEEN PICKED UP
A COUPLE TIMES FOR SOLICITING,

531
00:26:47,910 --> 00:26:49,520
ONCE FOR POSSESSION.

532
00:26:49,520 --> 00:26:52,741
SHE SKIPPED ON THAT APARTMENT
ABOUT A MONTH AGO,

533
00:26:52,741 --> 00:26:55,352
BUT HER P.O. GAVE US AN ADDRESS
THAT WAS GOOD AS OF LAST WEEK.CALL BURNSIDE. TELL HIM
WE'RE GONNA PICK HER UP.

534
00:26:55,352 --> 00:26:58,268
HEY, BOSS. THERE WAS
A CARMEN REYES WHO CALLED BRAVA

535
00:26:58,268 --> 00:27:01,010
ON HIS HOTEL PHONE TWICE
THE NIGHT BEFORE HE DIED.

536
00:27:01,010 --> 00:27:03,926
LEFT HER NAME ON
THE HOTEL MESSAGING SYSTEM.THERE'S NO RECORD
OF SALLY ALVAREZ

537
00:27:03,926 --> 00:27:07,190
CALLING THE HOTEL--
HOME OR CELL.WHERE DID THE CALL
ORIGINATE FROM?

538
00:27:07,190 --> 00:27:09,758
SUNSET HORIZON MOTOR COURT
IN SAN DESIDERA.

539
00:27:09,758 --> 00:27:13,240
A CARMEN REYES CHECKED IN
TWO DAYS AGO. SHE'S STILL THERE.ALL RIGHT.

540
00:27:13,240 --> 00:27:15,851
THEN WE'VE GOT TWO LOCATIONS
TO LOOK FOR HER AT.OR WE HAVE TWO CARMENS.

541
00:27:15,851 --> 00:27:17,418
TWO CARMENS?

542
00:27:17,418 --> 00:27:20,639
TWO CARMENS.WHAT DOES THAT MEAN,
TWO CARMENS?

543
00:27:20,639 --> 00:27:22,902
WELL, IT MEANS
THINGS ARE GETTING INTERESTING.

544
00:27:22,902 --> 00:27:25,034
AH, WELL, AS LONG
AS IT'S INTERESTING FOR YOU.

545
00:27:25,034 --> 00:27:26,906
I'LL GO WITH VAN PELT.

546
00:27:30,257 --> 00:27:33,390
THERE'S JUST SOMETHING
ABOUT MOTELS--

547
00:27:33,390 --> 00:27:37,525
OLD-FASHIONED AND ILLICIT,
BOTH AT THE SAME TIME.

548
00:27:37,525 --> 00:27:39,483
IS THAT AN INVITATION?

549
00:27:39,483 --> 00:27:42,835
WHOA. WELL, LOOK AT YOU, JUST
SHOWING UP LIKE A BAD PENNY.

550
00:27:42,835 --> 00:27:45,272
I HAD A PREMONITION
YOU'D BE HERE.

551
00:27:45,272 --> 00:27:47,100
REALLY?

552
00:27:47,100 --> 00:27:48,971
NO. LISBON TOLD ME.

553
00:27:48,971 --> 00:27:50,756
AH.

554
00:27:50,756 --> 00:27:52,975
UPSTAIRS. 204.

555
00:27:52,975 --> 00:27:55,630
GRACE, YOU KNOW KRISTINA?YEAH. HI.

556
00:27:55,630 --> 00:27:58,981
[Kristina] HI.DID YOUR PSYCHIC POWERS
TELL YOU TO COME?

557
00:27:58,981 --> 00:28:01,462
I DID HAVE AN INSTINCT
YOU WERE ABOUT TO GET

558
00:28:01,462 --> 00:28:04,073
A BREAK IN THIS CASE.[Patrick] OH, I THINK
YOU MIGHT HAVE JUST

559
00:28:04,073 --> 00:28:06,423
MADE AGENT VAN PELT'S DAY.[Van Pelt] WE'RE LOOKING
FOR CARMEN REYES.

560
00:28:06,423 --> 00:28:08,425
ACTUALLY, WE HAVE
TWO ADDRESSES FOR HER.

561
00:28:08,425 --> 00:28:11,385
THIS IS JUST ONE OF 'EM.
HER REAL NAME IS SALLY ALVAREZ.

562
00:28:11,385 --> 00:28:14,040
WAIT A SECOND. SALLY ALVAREZ.
I KNOW THAT NAME.

563
00:28:14,040 --> 00:28:16,346
SHE COMMUNICATED WITH ME
A SHORT TIME AGO.

564
00:28:16,346 --> 00:28:18,131
SHE'S PASSED OVER.

565
00:28:18,131 --> 00:28:21,612
I'M PRETTY SURE
SHE'S STILL IN THERE.

566
00:28:21,612 --> 00:28:23,005
[knocks on door]

567
00:28:23,005 --> 00:28:24,615
SALLY?

568
00:28:24,615 --> 00:28:26,008
[knocks]SALLY?

569
00:28:26,008 --> 00:28:28,402
OPEN IT UP.[lock clicks]

570
00:28:28,402 --> 00:28:30,709
STEP BACK, SIR.[man] OH.

571
00:28:34,800 --> 00:28:36,062
SHE'S DOWN.

572
00:28:41,197 --> 00:28:43,591
HEY, CHO.[Cho]
We found Sally Alvarez.

573
00:28:43,591 --> 00:28:46,463
SHE'S BEEN DEAD
FOR ABOUT SIX HOURS.

574
00:28:46,463 --> 00:28:49,728
Blunt force trauma
to the head.SHE'S DEAD? OH, MY GOD.
THAT'S AMAZING.

575
00:28:49,728 --> 00:28:53,819
WHY?Kristina Frye said Sally
passed over. She predicted it.

576
00:28:53,819 --> 00:28:55,690
SHE DID?YES.

577
00:28:55,690 --> 00:28:57,692
CAN I HAVE THAT?
THANK YOU.

578
00:28:57,692 --> 00:28:59,694
CHO, PLEASE DO NOT BELIEVE
THIS MYSTIC MUMBO JUMBO.

579
00:28:59,694 --> 00:29:01,609
GULLIBLE GRACE BURIED THE LEAD.

580
00:29:01,609 --> 00:29:05,004
[Patrick] I was right.
There were two Carmens.THERE WERE?

581
00:29:05,004 --> 00:29:08,007
THAT'S RIGHT, AND WE HAVE
THE REAL ONE RIGHT HERE.

582
00:29:08,007 --> 00:29:12,359
CARMEN REYES. SHE CLAIMS TO BE
HECTOR BRAVA'S DAUGHTER.

583
00:29:17,451 --> 00:29:20,323
A YEAR AGO, MY MOTHER WAS
DIAGNOSED WITH CANCER.

584
00:29:20,323 --> 00:29:22,848
UH, IT GOT BAD VERY FAST.

585
00:29:22,848 --> 00:29:25,111
SHE WAS GONE
IN LESS THAN A MONTH.

586
00:29:25,111 --> 00:29:28,679
BEFORE SHE DIED, SHE TOLD ME HECTOR BRAVA WAS MY FATHER.

587
00:29:28,679 --> 00:29:32,248
AND AFTER THE FUNERAL, I WROTE TO HIM.

588
00:29:32,248 --> 00:29:34,120
I NEVER HEARD BACK.

589
00:29:34,120 --> 00:29:38,689
I THOUGHT
MAYBE HE'D FORGOTTEN HER.

590
00:29:38,689 --> 00:29:41,301
I WROTE THERE WAS NOTHING
I WANTED FROM HIM,

591
00:29:41,301 --> 00:29:44,652
ONLY TO MEET THE MAN
WHO WAS MY FATHER.

592
00:29:44,652 --> 00:29:46,306
HE STILL DIDN'T ANSWER?

593
00:29:46,306 --> 00:29:49,700
I SAW SOMEWHERE THAT HE WAS
DELIVERING A SPEECH HERE.

594
00:29:49,700 --> 00:29:53,487
[chuckles] I THOUGHT
I'D GO CONFRONT HIM.

595
00:29:53,487 --> 00:29:55,097
YOU WERE ANGRY.

596
00:29:55,097 --> 00:29:57,883
I WANTED TO TALK TO HIM.

597
00:29:57,883 --> 00:29:59,798
DID YOU?

598
00:29:59,798 --> 00:30:01,190
WHEN?

599
00:30:01,190 --> 00:30:03,453
THE MORNING HE DIED?

600
00:30:03,453 --> 00:30:05,064
THE NIGHT BEFORE.

601
00:30:05,064 --> 00:30:07,457
I WENT TO HIS SUITE.

602
00:30:07,457 --> 00:30:09,808
WHAT HAPPENED?

603
00:30:09,808 --> 00:30:11,635
HE LET ME IN.

604
00:30:11,635 --> 00:30:14,943
HE WAS FRIENDLY,

605
00:30:14,943 --> 00:30:18,599
UNTIL I TOLD HIM
I WAS HIS DAUGHTER.

606
00:30:18,599 --> 00:30:23,778
HE GOT VERY UPSET
AND ANGRY.

607
00:30:23,778 --> 00:30:26,346
[Carmen] HE SAID,
I COULD NOT BE HIS DAUGHTER.

608
00:30:26,346 --> 00:30:29,175
HE SAID,
HE ALREADY MET HIS DAUGHTER,

609
00:30:29,175 --> 00:30:32,526
AND WHAT KIND OF SCAM WAS I TRYING TO PLAY?

610
00:30:32,526 --> 00:30:35,485
HE TURNED SO PALE
AND SHOOK ALL OVER.

611
00:30:35,485 --> 00:30:38,924
HE THREW ME
OUT OF THE ROOM

612
00:30:38,924 --> 00:30:40,534
AND LOCKED THE DOOR,

613
00:30:40,534 --> 00:30:42,536
SO I LEFT.

614
00:30:45,321 --> 00:30:47,497
AND THAT WAS LAST TIME
YOU SAW HIM?

615
00:30:49,804 --> 00:30:52,241
ON THE NEWS,
IT SAID WHAT HAPPENED.

616
00:30:54,156 --> 00:30:56,158
I DIDN'T KNOW WHAT TO DO.

617
00:30:56,158 --> 00:30:58,160
AND WHAT ABOUT
THE TEXT MESSAGE?

618
00:30:58,160 --> 00:30:59,509
DID YOU SEND THAT?

619
00:30:59,509 --> 00:31:02,904
I DON'T HAVE A PHONE.

620
00:31:02,904 --> 00:31:04,950
SO IS SHE TELLING
THE TRUTH?

621
00:31:04,950 --> 00:31:06,386
I'M NOT SURE.

622
00:31:06,386 --> 00:31:08,605
BRAVA'S SPIRIT IS
DEEPLY CONFLICTED.

623
00:31:08,605 --> 00:31:12,131
I CAN'T GET A CLEAR READING.WHAT ARE YOU USING,
DIAL-UP?

624
00:31:12,131 --> 00:31:15,177
[Lisbon] MY QUESTION IS,
IF SHE'S TELLING THE TRUTH,

625
00:31:15,177 --> 00:31:18,398
WHY WAS SALLY ALVAREZ PRETENDING
TO BE CARMEN REYES?

626
00:31:18,398 --> 00:31:20,052
I TALKED TO BIGELOW.

627
00:31:20,052 --> 00:31:22,184
HE KEPT A RECORD
OF ALL WORK CORRESPONDENCES

628
00:31:22,184 --> 00:31:25,231
BUT DIDN'T HAVE ANYTHING TO DO
WITH BRAVA'S PERSONAL LETTERS.

629
00:31:25,231 --> 00:31:29,104
THERE'S NO WAY TO KNOW
IF HER STORY CHECKS OUT OR NOT.IF BRAVA'S HER FATHER,
SHE'S GOT MOTIVE.

630
00:31:29,104 --> 00:31:31,280
SHE'S NOT THE ONLY ONE.

631
00:31:34,240 --> 00:31:36,416
[Ilsa]
I COULD NEVER HAVE CHILDREN.

632
00:31:39,114 --> 00:31:40,420
IS IT TRUE?

633
00:31:40,420 --> 00:31:42,639
IS SHE REALLY
HECTOR'S DAUGHTER?

634
00:31:42,639 --> 00:31:44,511
WE DON'T KNOW, MA'AM.

635
00:31:44,511 --> 00:31:48,384
SHE'S AGREED TO TAKE
A PATERNITY TEST.

636
00:31:48,384 --> 00:31:51,735
I THINK SHE MIGHT BE
TELLING THE TRUTH.SO YOU THINK SHE MIGHT BE
THE ONE THAT KILLED HECTOR.

637
00:31:51,735 --> 00:31:54,303
WELL, MAYBE...
AND THEN MAYBE IT WAS YOU.

638
00:31:54,303 --> 00:31:57,306
I HAVE TO SAY, MA'AM,
I-IT'S PRETTY HARD TO BELIEVE

639
00:31:57,306 --> 00:32:00,266
THAT YOU DIDN'T KNOW
ABOUT HIS BEHAVIOR.

640
00:32:00,266 --> 00:32:03,443
YES, I KNEW. HECTOR WAS
A PASSIONATE AND HEROIC MAN

641
00:32:03,443 --> 00:32:06,228
WHO DEVOTED HIMSELF
TO HELPING OTHERS.

642
00:32:06,228 --> 00:32:08,752
HIS FLAWS WERE
CORRESPONDINGLY OVERSIZED.

643
00:32:08,752 --> 00:32:11,103
AND HIS BEHAVIOR WAS OKAY
WITH YOU?

644
00:32:11,103 --> 00:32:13,453
I ACCEPTED IT.

645
00:32:13,453 --> 00:32:16,456
THE GOOD IN HIM OUTWEIGHED
THE BAD.

646
00:32:16,456 --> 00:32:18,110
IF HE'D TOLD ME,

647
00:32:18,110 --> 00:32:20,503
MAYBE I COULD'VE DONE
SOMETHING TO PREVENT IT.

648
00:32:20,503 --> 00:32:24,420
MAYBE I COULD'VE SAVED HIM.WHAT FOR?
HOW COULD YOU NOT WANT

649
00:32:24,420 --> 00:32:27,075
TO GET AWAY
FROM HIS SERIAL PHILANDERING,

650
00:32:27,075 --> 00:32:30,296
FROM THE PRISON
OF YOUR LOVELESS MARRIAGE?THAT'S NOT TRUE!

651
00:32:30,296 --> 00:32:32,951
I LOVED MY HUSBAND,
AND HE LOVED ME!

652
00:32:32,951 --> 00:32:36,519
WELL, MAYBE WE CAN GET
IN CONTACT WITH HIM NOW.

653
00:32:36,519 --> 00:32:39,696
YOU COULD DO THAT,
COULDN'T YOU?IT WOULD CERTAINLY CLEAR UP
A FEW THINGS.

654
00:32:39,696 --> 00:32:43,657
WOULD YOU DO THAT?
WOULD YOU TALK TO MY HUSBAND?

655
00:32:43,657 --> 00:32:46,181
YES, ILSA.

656
00:32:46,181 --> 00:32:48,488
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?WHAT DOES IT LOOK
LIKE I'M DOING?

657
00:32:50,316 --> 00:32:52,971
OKAY, SO VAN PELT IS
BRINGING CARMEN.

658
00:32:52,971 --> 00:32:54,973
RIGSBY'S GONNA BRING
RICHARD BIGELOW.

659
00:32:54,973 --> 00:32:57,932
CHO IS GONNA PICK UP
TARIQ SHARIF AND STACEY.

660
00:32:57,932 --> 00:32:59,325
SO WE'RE ALL SET.

661
00:32:59,325 --> 00:33:01,327
WHAT'S ALL SET FOR WHAT?

662
00:33:01,327 --> 00:33:04,417
WE'RE ALL SET
FOR, UH, KRISTINA FRYE

663
00:33:04,417 --> 00:33:07,202
TO CONTACT
HECTOR BRAVA'S SPIRIT.I NEED EVERYBODY CONNECTED
WITH HIS PASSING.

664
00:33:07,202 --> 00:33:10,771
OKAY. WELL, UH, I GUESS...
[clears throat][lowered voice]
NOW LISTEN, JUST MAKE SURE

665
00:33:10,771 --> 00:33:13,034
BRAVA'S SPIRIT HAS A THIRST
FOR REVENGE.

666
00:33:13,034 --> 00:33:16,037
HE WANTS TO PUT SOME KIND
OF A CURSE ON THE KILLER,

667
00:33:16,037 --> 00:33:18,779
YOU KNOW WHAT I MEAN?
THAT KIND OF THING.

668
00:33:18,779 --> 00:33:22,174
AND THEN I'LL TAKE IT
FROM THERE.I CAN'T DO THAT.

669
00:33:22,174 --> 00:33:25,133
YES, YOU CAN.
IT IS A NECESSARY LIE.I CAN ONLY CONTACT
HECTOR BRAVA'S SPIRIT

670
00:33:25,133 --> 00:33:27,483
AND SPEAK
AS HE WANTS ME TO.

671
00:33:27,483 --> 00:33:30,008
TO DO OTHERWISE WOULD BE
TO ABUSE MY GIFT.

672
00:33:33,228 --> 00:33:34,882
EVERYTHING OKAY?

673
00:33:34,882 --> 00:33:36,840
YEP. EVERYTHING'S GOOD.
IT'S PERFECT.

674
00:33:39,974 --> 00:33:42,194
[Ilsa] ARE WE STARTING NOW?

675
00:33:42,194 --> 00:33:43,586
[Kristina] ALMOST.

676
00:33:43,586 --> 00:33:45,545
I'LL JUST GET THE DOOR.

677
00:33:45,545 --> 00:33:47,808
WELCOME.

678
00:33:47,808 --> 00:33:49,940
[Patrick] COME ON IN.

679
00:33:49,940 --> 00:33:51,899
THANKS FOR COMING.

680
00:33:53,422 --> 00:33:56,034
IT WAS
YOUR HUSBAND'S REQUEST.

681
00:33:57,383 --> 00:34:00,038
YOUR HUSBAND'S DAUGHTER.

682
00:34:05,652 --> 00:34:08,220
[clears throat]

683
00:34:08,220 --> 00:34:09,873
[sighs]

684
00:34:09,873 --> 00:34:13,616
WELL, THANK YOU ALL FOR COMING.

685
00:34:13,616 --> 00:34:15,618
PATRICK WILL BE
ASSISTING ME.

686
00:34:15,618 --> 00:34:18,273
SO IN ORDER
FOR THIS TO WORK,

687
00:34:18,273 --> 00:34:21,363
I NEED EVERYBODY
TO BE CALM AND FOCUSED.

688
00:34:21,363 --> 00:34:24,975
I WANT YOU TO LOOK AT THE CANDLE
IN THE CENTER OF THE TABLE.

689
00:34:24,975 --> 00:34:28,544
FOCUS ON THE FLAME
AND CONCENTRATE ON HECTOR.

690
00:34:36,161 --> 00:34:37,771
[inhales deeply]

691
00:34:37,771 --> 00:34:41,731
[exhales deeply]

692
00:34:44,038 --> 00:34:47,215
NOW... HE'S HERE.

693
00:34:49,783 --> 00:34:51,524
I CAN FEEL HIM.

694
00:34:53,830 --> 00:34:56,659
HECTOR...

695
00:34:56,659 --> 00:35:00,794
WHO DO YOU WISH
TO SPEAK TO?

696
00:35:00,794 --> 00:35:02,187
[gasps]

697
00:35:02,187 --> 00:35:04,058
[exhales deeply]

698
00:35:04,058 --> 00:35:05,320
THE KILLER'S HERE.

699
00:35:09,281 --> 00:35:11,935
KNOW THIS--

700
00:35:11,935 --> 00:35:14,460
HECTOR BRAVA SAYS...

701
00:35:14,460 --> 00:35:17,419
VENGEANCE WILL COME.

702
00:35:17,419 --> 00:35:20,118
YOUR BLOOD WILL SPILL...

703
00:35:20,118 --> 00:35:23,077
[Patrick exhales deeply]BEFORE THE RISING SUN.

704
00:35:23,077 --> 00:35:27,212
OHH. I SENSE HIM.

705
00:35:27,212 --> 00:35:30,171
[exhales deeply]

706
00:35:30,171 --> 00:35:32,304
I-I CAN ALMOST SEE
AN IMAGE.

707
00:35:32,304 --> 00:35:33,609
I-I-IT'S HAZY.

708
00:35:35,437 --> 00:35:38,397
OH, IT...

709
00:35:38,397 --> 00:35:40,964
OHH,
IT'S AS IF IT COULD JUST--

710
00:35:40,964 --> 00:35:42,401
HECTOR. HECTOR, WAIT.

711
00:35:42,401 --> 00:35:44,751
STOP. DON'T GO.

712
00:35:44,751 --> 00:35:46,622
SHOW US
WHO THE KILLER IS.

713
00:35:46,622 --> 00:35:49,234
THERE IT IS.

714
00:35:49,234 --> 00:35:51,932
A DOOR.

715
00:35:51,932 --> 00:35:55,457
"EMPLOYEES ONLY."

716
00:35:55,457 --> 00:35:57,807
AND AN EMPTY HALLWAY.

717
00:35:57,807 --> 00:35:59,331
[footsteps echoing]

718
00:35:59,331 --> 00:36:02,421
FOOTSTEPS... CLOSE...

719
00:36:02,421 --> 00:36:04,379
CLOSE...

720
00:36:04,379 --> 00:36:06,033
[thud]

721
00:36:06,033 --> 00:36:07,991
AAH! UGH![gasps] OH!

722
00:36:07,991 --> 00:36:10,603
I SEE YOU.

723
00:36:10,603 --> 00:36:13,345
[Richard exhales deeply]
I'M SORRY.

724
00:36:13,345 --> 00:36:15,173
MAN, YOU SCARED ME
TO DEATH WITH THAT.

725
00:36:15,173 --> 00:36:18,393
[chuckles] WHEW.IT'S OKAY.
YOU CAN RELAX, BIGELOW.

726
00:36:18,393 --> 00:36:22,136
IT'S OVER. I KNOW
IT WAS YOU THAT DID IT.WHAT, BECAUSE I GOT FRANTIC
AND FELL OUT OF MY CHAIR?

727
00:36:22,136 --> 00:36:24,356
BECAUSE YOU MANAGED
BRAVA'S CORRESPONDENCE,

728
00:36:24,356 --> 00:36:26,836
YOU WERE THE FIRST ONE
TO READ CARMEN'S LETTERS, YES?

729
00:36:26,836 --> 00:36:29,056
YOU SET BRAVA UP
ON A DATE WITH SALLY

730
00:36:29,056 --> 00:36:32,059
AND HAD HER PRETEND TO BE
CARMEN, AND THEN YOU TOLD BRAVA

731
00:36:32,059 --> 00:36:35,541
THAT HE HAD SEX
WITH HIS OWN DAUGHTER.LORD.

732
00:36:35,541 --> 00:36:38,674
AND THEN THE REAL DEAL
SHOWED UP,

733
00:36:38,674 --> 00:36:41,634
SO YOU FAKED CARMEN'S MESSAGE,
AND WHEN BRAVA WALKED THROUGH

734
00:36:41,634 --> 00:36:44,027
THAT SERVICE DOOR,
YOU KILLED HIM.

735
00:36:44,027 --> 00:36:45,986
[Lisbon] AND YOU KILLED
POOR SALLY ALVAREZ

736
00:36:45,986 --> 00:36:48,380
TO COVER YOUR TRACKS.[Patrick] MM-HMM.

737
00:36:48,380 --> 00:36:52,079
AND NOW YOU'LL PAY
FOR THE CRIME YOU COMMITTED.

738
00:36:52,079 --> 00:36:54,429
YOUR BLOOD WILL SPILL
BEFORE THE SUN RISES.

739
00:36:54,429 --> 00:36:58,041
THAT PART
I'M NOT SO SURE ABOUT.

740
00:37:04,265 --> 00:37:06,267
[Bigelow]
IT CAME IN THE MAIL.

741
00:37:06,267 --> 00:37:09,401
JUST OUT OF THE BLUE.
JUST A...

742
00:37:09,401 --> 00:37:13,318
LETTER DESCRIBING AN AFFAIR
BRAVA HAD 20 YEARS AGO,

743
00:37:13,318 --> 00:37:15,363
NAMING THE WOMAN
AND THE PLACE.

744
00:37:15,363 --> 00:37:17,670
AND THAT CAME FROM CARMEN REYES.
THE REAL CARMEN.

745
00:37:19,628 --> 00:37:21,587
THAT GAVE YOU
ALL THE FACTS YOU NEEDED--

746
00:37:21,587 --> 00:37:23,328
THINGS ABOUT THE AFFAIR

747
00:37:23,328 --> 00:37:26,113
THAT ONLY BRAVA
AND CARMEN'S MOTHER WOULD KNOW.

748
00:37:26,113 --> 00:37:27,984
RIGHT?YEAH.

749
00:37:35,253 --> 00:37:37,994
SO WHY'D YOU DO IT?

750
00:37:37,994 --> 00:37:40,693
WHY PUT A MAN
THROUGH THAT KIND OF SUFFERING?

751
00:37:42,477 --> 00:37:44,523
WAS IT THE MONEY?

752
00:37:44,523 --> 00:37:48,048
OR DID YOU JUST LIKE
HAVING BRAVA IN YOUR POWER?

753
00:37:48,048 --> 00:37:51,007
DO YOU KNOW I'VE BEEN RUNNING
NUMBERS ON TRAFFICKING FOR BRAVA

754
00:37:51,007 --> 00:37:55,142
AND SETTING HIM UP ON HIS DATES
FOR, LIKE, FIVE YEARS?

755
00:37:55,142 --> 00:37:58,101
AND DO YOU THINK THAT HE EVER,

756
00:37:58,101 --> 00:38:00,495
EVER THANKED ME?

757
00:38:00,495 --> 00:38:02,541
SAID, "I'M SORRY"?

758
00:38:02,541 --> 00:38:06,240
SAID, "I'M GONNA MAKE THIS UP
TO YOU ONE DAY, RUSSELL"?

759
00:38:06,240 --> 00:38:10,505
I KNEW SALLY
FROM A WHOREHOUSE

760
00:38:10,505 --> 00:38:12,551
UP IN NORTHERN CALIFORNIA.

761
00:38:12,551 --> 00:38:15,118
I TOLD HER
IF SHE PRETENDED TO BE CARMEN,

762
00:38:15,118 --> 00:38:17,773
WE COULD BLACKMAIL BRAVA
AND SPLIT THE MONEY.

763
00:38:17,773 --> 00:38:20,167
THE LETTER JUST GAVE US
EVERYTHING WE NEEDED

764
00:38:20,167 --> 00:38:23,170
TO MAKE BRAVA THINK THAT SHE
WAS THE REAL DEAL. [chuckles]

765
00:38:23,170 --> 00:38:26,739
AND HE WAS NOT ONE FOR ASKING
A WHOLE LOT OF QUESTIONS, SO...

766
00:38:29,611 --> 00:38:31,613
THEN THE REAL CARMEN
SHOWED UP.

767
00:38:31,613 --> 00:38:33,354
YEAH.

768
00:38:33,354 --> 00:38:36,314
HE CALLED ME
AS SOON AS SHE LEFT HIS ROOM,

769
00:38:36,314 --> 00:38:39,360
FREAKED. SO I PLAYED DUMB.

770
00:38:39,360 --> 00:38:41,971
BUT THEN THE NEXT MORNING,
HE CALLED ME

771
00:38:41,971 --> 00:38:44,322
AND HE SAID,
"WE NEED TO TALK."

772
00:38:44,322 --> 00:38:46,672
IT WAS PRETTY CLEAR
HE FIGURED IT OUT.

773
00:38:46,672 --> 00:38:48,674
AND SO YOU WENT TO THE HOTEL

774
00:38:48,674 --> 00:38:50,850
AND TEXTED BRAVA
FROM THE SERVICE HALLWAY.

775
00:39:01,513 --> 00:39:02,775
[crash]

776
00:39:11,174 --> 00:39:15,091
I JUST--I JUST WANTED
TO KEEP HIM QUIET.

777
00:39:15,091 --> 00:39:16,702
AND SALLY ALVAREZ?

778
00:39:16,702 --> 00:39:19,313
YOU HAD TO KEEP HER QUIET,
TOO, RIGHT?

779
00:39:21,576 --> 00:39:25,232
YOU KNOW,
I WAS A REALLY GOOD RESEARCHER.

780
00:39:25,232 --> 00:39:28,278
I BET.

781
00:39:28,278 --> 00:39:30,193
COME ON.

782
00:39:37,026 --> 00:39:39,202
AGENT VAN PELT,
YOU WANTED TO SEE ME?

783
00:39:39,202 --> 00:39:41,248
OH, YEAH. HI, CARMEN.

784
00:39:41,248 --> 00:39:44,207
I JUST WANTED TO GO OVER
A FEW THINGS IN YOUR STATEMENT.

785
00:39:44,207 --> 00:39:46,122
LET'S GO IN THE KITCHEN.

786
00:39:52,955 --> 00:39:54,261
SO... [sighs]

787
00:39:56,132 --> 00:39:58,221
NICE WORKING WITH YOU.

788
00:39:58,221 --> 00:40:00,267
YEAH.

789
00:40:00,267 --> 00:40:02,487
YEAH, YOU WERE VERY GOOD
BACK THERE.

790
00:40:02,487 --> 00:40:05,098
UH, YOU ALMOST HAD ME
WITH THE WHOLE

791
00:40:05,098 --> 00:40:08,101
"I CAN'T MISUSE MY GIFT FOR FEAR
OF WHAT MIGHT HAPPEN" BIT.

792
00:40:08,101 --> 00:40:10,146
I DID WHAT I SAID I WOULD.

793
00:40:10,146 --> 00:40:12,975
I SPOKE THE WORDS THE SPIRITS
TOLD ME TO SPEAK, NOTHING MORE.

794
00:40:12,975 --> 00:40:15,238
REALLY?

795
00:40:15,238 --> 00:40:17,240
DON'T YOU KNOW ME BY NOW?

796
00:40:17,240 --> 00:40:20,635
DON'T YOU KNOW I WOULDN'T LIE
ABOUT A THING LIKE THAT?

797
00:40:20,635 --> 00:40:23,508
MS. FRYE,
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

798
00:40:23,508 --> 00:40:27,163
WE COULDN'T HAVE CLOSED THIS ONE
WITHOUT YOU.WELL, THAT'S DEBATABLE.

799
00:40:27,163 --> 00:40:28,730
YOU'RE WELCOME.

800
00:40:28,730 --> 00:40:30,776
ALTHOUGH I HAVE TO SAY

801
00:40:30,776 --> 00:40:33,169
IT LOOKS LIKE THE SPIRITS
GOT IT WRONG.

802
00:40:33,169 --> 00:40:36,129
I GUESS BEING DEAD
DOESN'T MAKE YOU INFALLIBLE.WELL, WHAT DO YOU MEAN?

803
00:40:36,129 --> 00:40:38,871
THE KILLER WAS CAUGHT,
AND JUSTICE WAS SERVED.

804
00:40:38,871 --> 00:40:40,568
SURE.
BUT NO BLOOD WAS SPILLED.

805
00:40:40,568 --> 00:40:43,397
LOOK, HE'S RIGHT THERE.

806
00:40:43,397 --> 00:40:46,095
[crunch]HEY! HEY, HEY!

807
00:40:46,095 --> 00:40:48,446
MURDERER! [grunts]

808
00:40:48,446 --> 00:40:50,448
OH!

809
00:40:50,448 --> 00:40:53,886
[gasping]

810
00:40:55,627 --> 00:40:58,194
OH, COME ON.

811
00:41:01,241 --> 00:41:03,025
THAT WAS PURE LUCK.

812
00:41:03,025 --> 00:41:04,157
ADMIT IT.

813
00:41:04,157 --> 00:41:05,811
IF YOU SAY SO.

814
00:41:05,811 --> 00:41:07,639
OH, I KNOWSO.

815
00:41:07,639 --> 00:41:11,077
THE DEAD ARE DEAD.
YOU CAN'T TALK TO THEM.

816
00:41:11,077 --> 00:41:13,427
AND YET I DO.

817
00:41:13,427 --> 00:41:16,909
YEAH...

818
00:41:16,909 --> 00:41:19,302
YOU'RE VERY GOOD.

819
00:41:19,302 --> 00:41:21,479
I GO THIS WAY.

820
00:41:21,479 --> 00:41:24,046
OKAY.IT WAS NICE
SEEING YOU AGAIN.

821
00:41:24,046 --> 00:41:25,831
YOU, TOO.

822
00:41:25,831 --> 00:41:28,007
BYE.

823
00:41:28,007 --> 00:41:29,487
KRISTINA?

824
00:41:29,487 --> 00:41:31,489
YES.

825
00:41:31,489 --> 00:41:33,099
THAT'S WITH A "K," RIGHT?

826
00:41:33,099 --> 00:41:34,709
YES.

827
00:41:36,668 --> 00:41:39,758
YOU WANNA GO GET A COFFEE?

828
00:41:39,758 --> 00:41:41,760
I'LL DRINK TEA MYSELF,

829
00:41:41,760 --> 00:41:44,589
BUT YOU CAN DRINK
AS MUCH COFFEE AS YOU WANT.YEAH, I'D LIKE THAT.

830
00:41:44,589 --> 00:41:47,548
I CAN'T RIGHT NOW, THOUGH.
I-I HAVE TO BE SOMEWHERE ELSE.

831
00:41:47,548 --> 00:41:49,376
UH, MAYBE SOME OTHER TIME?

832
00:41:49,376 --> 00:41:51,726
SOME OTHER TIME.

833
00:41:51,726 --> 00:41:54,120
SORRY, NOT "MAYBE."
DEFINITELY.

834
00:41:54,120 --> 00:41:56,165
SOMETIME SOON.

835
00:41:56,165 --> 00:41:58,080
CALL ME.

836
00:42:17,447 --> 00:42:20,233
STAY TUNED FOR SCENES
FROM OUR NEXT EPISODE.

